---
/**
 * AboutStory.astro — Seção "The Story" da About.
 * Layout base do Figma: grid 625 | 625 (label esquerda, corpo direita).
 * Toque Awwwards: hierarquia tipográfica precisa, hairline divider no topo,
 * body em size maior que h10 pra ter presença como bio pessoal.
 */
---

<section class="about_story">
  <div class="about_story-contain">
    <div class="line-reveal line-reveal--top"></div>
    <div class="about_story-grid">
      <div class="about_story-left">
        <h2 class="about_story-label fadeUp-mask"><span class="fadeUp">The Story</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="about_story-right">
        <p class="about_story-para">
          I collect websites the way some people collect records. Sites
          where the type breathes, the scroll doesn't just move but
          reveals, the button remembers you touched it. Building those,
          for other people, is what I do.
        </p>
        <p class="about_story-para">
          I work remote from Goiás, Brazil, with founders and small teams
          who care how a product feels the moment it opens. Recent work
          includes an edtech reaching 500K+ students, a compliance firm
          rebuilding for market authority, and a wedding platform with
          automated PIX payments. Different stakes, same standard.
        </p>
        <p class="about_story-para">
          Between projects, I'm always consuming art. Digital work,
          mostly. It's how I keep the next thing I ship a step ahead of
          the last.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about_story {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .about_story-contain {
    max-width: var(--page-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 0 6rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Mobile: coluna única, label em cima */
  .about_story-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3rem;
    padding-top: 3rem;
  }

  .about_story-label {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .about_story-right {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.4rem;
    max-width: 56rem;
  }

  .about_story-para {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  /* Tablet: 2 colunas iguais */
  @media (min-width: 580px) {
    .about_story-contain {
      padding: 5rem 0 8rem;
    }
    .about_story-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0;
      padding-top: 4rem;
    }
    .about_story-label {
      font-size: 4.4rem;
    }
    .about_story-para {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
  }

  /* Desktop: mantém 62.5rem | 1fr, label H1 style, body 24px */
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .about_story-contain {
      padding: 6rem 0 10rem;
    }
    .about_story-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 62.5rem 1fr;
      padding-top: 5rem;
    }
    .about_story-label {
      font-size: 6.4rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    }
    .about_story-right {
      max-width: 56rem;
      gap: 2.8rem;
    }
    .about_story-para {
      font-size: 2.4rem;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
  }
</style>
